# format: snapshot_section carrying the timeline segment-reference payload
# section_kind: 5 (#3643, docs/design/3643-timeline-segments.md §2.3)
# section_data_len: 124 = u32 group_count + 2 x (16-byte branch + u32 ref_count) + 2 x 40-byte ref
# group 1: ordinary branch id 00..0f, 0 refs (a complete, empty timeline)
# group 2: a5 x 16, 2 refs
#   ref 1: sealing snapshot 3 | ordinal 0 | 65536 entries | versions 1..=65536 | crc 0x01020304
#   ref 2 (tail): sealing snapshot 4 | ordinal 1 | 2 entries | versions 65537..=65541 | crc 0xa0b0c0d0
# hex:
05 7c 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 00 01 02
03 04 05 06 07 08 09 0a 0b 0c 0d 0e 0f 00 00 00
00 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5 a5
a5 02 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
00 00 00 01 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 01
00 00 00 00 00 04 03 02 01 00 00 00 00 04 00 00
00 00 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 02 00 00 00 01 00 01
00 00 00 00 00 05 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 d0 c0 b0
a0 00 00 00 00
